    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "Hi, \r\nPython docstring, usually surround by 6 quote as below,\r\n``` python\r\ndef foo():\r\n    \"\"\"\r\n    This is a python doc string\r\n    \"\"\"\r\n```\r\nIs it possible to acheive with mini.pairs where inserting `\"\"\"` makes `\"\"\" \"\"\"`?",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Hi,<br>\nPython docstring, usually surround by 6 quote as below,</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-python notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"def foo():\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;\n    This is a python doc string\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">def</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">foo</span>():\n    <span class=\"pl-s\">\"\"\"</span>\n<span class=\"pl-s\">    This is a python doc string</span>\n<span class=\"pl-s\">    \"\"\"</span></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Is it possible to acheive with mini.pairs where inserting <code class=\"notranslate\">\"\"\"</code> makes <code class=\"notranslate\">\"\"\" \"\"\"</code>?</p>",
    "bodyText": "Hi,\nPython docstring, usually surround by 6 quote as below,\ndef foo():\n    \"\"\"\n    This is a python doc string\n    \"\"\"\nIs it possible to acheive with mini.pairs where inserting \"\"\" makes \"\"\" \"\"\"?",
