        {
            "author": {
                "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11474625?u=93e7f7525efc8efbc0823cdb5780789c824ab4de&v=4",
                "login": "Susensio",
                "resourcePath": "/Susensio",
                "url": "https://github.com/Susensio"
            },
            "authorAssociation": "NONE",
            "body": "Just for reference, I was very annoyed that typing 3 `\"` inserted the fourth unwanted quote\r\n```\r\n\"\"\"|\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis, at least, solves that annoyance\r\n```\r\nmappings = {\r\n  ['\"'] = { action = 'closeopen', pair = '\"\"', neigh_pattern = '[^\\\\\"].', register = { cr = false } },\r\n}\r\n```\r\nIt uses prev neigh pattern to disable opening if right of quote. ~The downside is that you cannot insert quotes inside quotes but.. who does that?~ That wasn't possible bc closing action would skip the next quote, so... I like this solution even more",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Just for reference, I was very annoyed that typing 3 <code class=\"notranslate\">\"</code> inserted the fourth unwanted quote</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"&quot;&quot;&quot;|&quot;\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">\"\"\"|\"\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This, at least, solves that annoyance</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"mappings = {\n  ['&quot;'] = { action = 'closeopen', pair = '&quot;&quot;', neigh_pattern = '[^\\\\&quot;].', register = { cr = false } },\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">mappings = {\n  ['\"'] = { action = 'closeopen', pair = '\"\"', neigh_pattern = '[^\\\\\"].', register = { cr = false } },\n}\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">It uses prev neigh pattern to disable opening if right of quote. <del>The downside is that you cannot insert quotes inside quotes but.. who does that?</del> That wasn't possible bc closing action would skip the next quote, so... I like this solution even more</p>",
            "bodyText": "Just for reference, I was very annoyed that typing 3 \" inserted the fourth unwanted quote\n\"\"\"|\"\n\nThis, at least, solves that annoyance\nmappings = {\n  ['\"'] = { action = 'closeopen', pair = '\"\"', neigh_pattern = '[^\\\\\"].', register = { cr = false } },\n}\n\nIt uses prev neigh pattern to disable opening if right of quote. The downside is that you cannot insert quotes inside quotes but.. who does that? That wasn't possible bc closing action would skip the next quote, so... I like this solution even more",
